  "body": "* Three bedrooms, one bathroom, a separate toilet and a double internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 150sqm floor area on a 291sqm section\r\n* Open-plan living and dining area\r\n* Spacious conservatory offering additional living space\r\n* Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Easy-care grounds\r\n* Within walking distance of Orewa Beach, cafés, parks and local amenities\r\n\r\nOffering a practical layout and an easy-care lifestyle, this well-presented home is an appealing choice for first-home buyers, downsizers or those seeking a convenient base close to the coast.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area creates a welcoming central space, with the kitchen positioned alongside for everyday convenience. Three well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, complemented by a family bathroom and a separate toilet. A heat pump adds comfort throughout the seasons, while the neutral interior provides a relaxed setting ready to make your own.\r\n\r\nA standout feature is the spacious conservatory, offering valuable additional room to relax, entertain or simply enjoy the outlook across the outdoor area. Outside, the compact grounds are easy to maintain, leaving more time to enjoy the surrounding lifestyle. A double internal-access garage provides secure parking and useful storage.\r\n\r\nLocation adds further appeal, with beautiful Orewa Beach within walking distance and cafés, parks, shops and other everyday amenities close by. Convenient access to SH1 also makes travelling to the wider Auckland region straightforward.\r\n\r\nCombining practical living spaces, easy-care grounds and a sought-after coastal setting, this is an opportunity to enjoy the relaxed Orewa lifestyle with everyday conveniences close at hand.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
